    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: dbe8d485401eb4c76809f0382a1b232936f346fd -->\n**PR-reviewer verdict: clean (merge-ready).** Read-only review of the diff, no build (author's structural run and clippy taken as given).\n\n- Single file changed: `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/structural.rs`. No other changes.\n- Expected version comes from `crate::build_info::toolbar_version()`, which is `v0.0.0` under test on origin/main. The real `CARGO_PKG_VERSION` is no longer referenced here.\n- The assertion still pins the identity: it panics unless a painted text starts with that version, and it still requires that text's y to sit above the dock tabs (`build.y < tab_y`). Passing with no identity is not possible. The `starts_with` match is a little looser than equality but covers both ribbon forms (`v0.0.0 · test` and bare `v0.0.0`), which is what the code paints.\n- `unwrap_or_else(panic)` appears only in test code, which AGENTS.md allows.\n- Mergeable: MERGEABLE. Head `dbe8d485`.\n",
